  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本模组新增了便携垃圾桶，可自动清除背包中选定的物品。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">垃圾桶会自动移除你放入过滤栏中的物品。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/648789/description_bb604a30-c010-4e52-a001-57e81384acca.png\" width=\"446\" height=\"228\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;垃圾桶合成配方</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/648789/description_e14519c7-6ae4-4ce8-acbe-90061e827c53.png\" width=\"446\" height=\"199\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我同意在公开整合包中使用此模组。</span></p><div></div><p><img style=\"width:25px;display:none\" src=\"\"></p>",
